    <!-- 首页头部说明 -->
    <string name="module_desc">\nAdds a fourth home mode to Xiaomi Home (com.miui.home, adaptive across OS2/OS3).\nSwitching goes through the native chain and never conflicts with the three native modes.\nNote: turn off the system “Simple mode” first.</string>

