    <string name="root_probing">root status: checking… (Magisk prompt on first run — choose Allow)</string>
    <string name="gate_open_notif">Open notification access settings</string>
    <string name="gate_hint">root keep-alive prevents MIUI battery saver from unbinding the notification listener service (a\nprerequisite of the media/notification row); if notification access is lost the home screen falls back\nto native automatically and restores once access returns — no re-toggle needed. Notification content\nis bridged in memory only, never stored or uploaded.</string>
